※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Bonanza will be available after Unleashing the Cats is cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (3/28, 3/30, 4/2, 4/4, 4/6, 4/8, 4/10)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd days (3/27, 3/29, 3/31, 4/1, 4/3, 4/5, 4/7, 4/9)'''}} head to {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''3/27, 3/30, 4/2, 4/5, 4/8!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas Cats Eye Cave and XP Harvest for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
On between March 27th (11:00am) and April 3rd (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
On between April 3rd (11:00am) and April 10th (10:59am)!

Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
On between March 27th (11:00am) and April 3rd (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
On between April 3rd (11:00am) and April 10th (10:59am)!

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!<br>
Earn victory to pick up Cat Tickets and Rare Tickets!<br>
Show up at the confession spot for your Moment of Truth, and boost the + Levels of your crush and the rest of your gang of friends!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・"Weekend ~Another Confession~" stage now available!'''}}<br>
By clearing {{Color|#FF0000|'''Weekend: Confession'''}}, a new, more challenging stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Weekend ~Another Confession~"'''}} will be unlocked, which has Cat Tickets and Rare Tickets waiting for those who complete it!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited Heartbeat Catcademy Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Only during this event, visit the Heartbeat Catcademy Capsules from the Cat Base to draw spectacular limited-edition prizes like Special Cats, Items, and XP rewards!<br>
Collect lots of limited {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Love Letter'''}} special items and exchange them for limited Special heroes {{Color|#0000FF|'''"Secret Crush Cat", "Tomboy Lion Cat", "Chalkboard Eraser Cat", "Class Rep Cat"'''}} or useful battle items and XP rewards!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''※ These Limited Special heroes cannot be upgraded using XP. To power up these characters, you must upgrade their + Levels through event features.'''}}<br>
※ Limited Event Capsules can only be used by spending limited event items collected from event stages.<br>
※ Please be aware that limited items may only be used before the end of the event period.<br>
※ Please be aware that limited items not used during the event period cannot be exchanged for other items or experience.<br>
※ If the event does not appear, please make sure that you are updated to the latest version of the Battle Cats app.<br>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited Heartbeat Catcademy Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Make sure to show up each day to get perfect attendance and earn all the prizes available from this limited login stamp campaign!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between March 13th (11:00am) and April 10th (10:59am)!'''}}

During this event, make sure to {{Color|#FF0000|'''login each day'''}} to earn prizes like {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Love Letters'''}}, Rare Tickets, and other useful items that will help you on your Battle Cats journey!

